os","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3APhalaenopsis_hieroglyphica_toapel.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e8/Kingidium_taenialis_1_toapel.jpg/500px-Kingidium_taenialis_1_toapel.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e8/Kingidium_taenialis_1_toapel.jpg/500px-Kingidium_taenialis_1_toapel.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Phalaenopsis taenialis of Phalaenopsis sect. Aphyllae","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AKingidium_taenialis_1_toapel.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a1/Phalaenopsis_lobbii_%28Rchb.f.%29_H.R.Sweet%2C_Gen._Phalaenopsis_53_%281980%29_%2839946000844%29.jpg/500px-Phalaenopsis_lobbii_%28Rchb.f.%29_H.R.Sweet%2C_Gen._Phalaenopsis_53_%281980%29_%2839946000844%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a1/Phalaenopsis_lobbii_%28Rchb.f.%29_H.R.Sweet%2C_Gen._Phalaenopsis_53_%281980%29_%2839946000844%29.jpg/1280px-Phalaenopsis_lobbii_%28Rchb.f.%29_H.R.Sweet%2C_Gen._Phalaenopsis_53_%281980%29_%2839946000844%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a1/Phalaenopsis_lobbii_%28Rchb.f.%29_H.R.Sweet%2C_Gen._Phalaenopsis_53_%281980%29_%2839946000844%29.jpg/500px-Phalaenopsis_lobbii_%28Rchb.f.%29_H.R.Sweet%2C_Gen._Phalaenopsis_53_%281980%29_%2839946000844%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Phalaenopsis lobbii of Phalaenopsis sect. Parishianae","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3APhalaenopsis_lobbii_(Rchb.f.)_H.R.Sweet%2C_Gen._Phalaenopsis_53_(1980)_(39946000844).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d9/Pneumatodes_on_Phalaenopsis_philippinensis_root.j